@startuml
title Sequence — мини-приложение: поиск → запись → напоминание

participant "WebApp Bridge\n(window.WebApp)" as B
participant "Мини-приложение\n(React SPA)" as MA
participant "Backend API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

MA -> B: initData / initDataUnsafe (user, chat, start_param)
B --> MA: initData (для валидации x-init-data)
MA -> API: POST /api/me { initData } → resolveSession
activate API
API -> DB: resolve_or_create_user
DB --> API
API --> MA: { user, demo, validated }
deactivate API

MA -> API: GET /api/activities?lat&lng&{фильтры}
activate API
API -> DB: get_activities
DB --> API
API --> MA: ActivitySummary[]
deactivate API
MA --> User: ResultsPage

MA -> API: GET /api/activities/{id}
activate API
API -> DB: get_activity_detail
DB --> API
API --> MA: ActivityDetail (schedule + тренеры + оценки)
deactivate API

MA -> API: POST /api/registrations { slotId, name, consent }
activate API
API -> DB: create_registration (проверки)
DB --> API
API --> MA: RegistrationView
deactivate API

alt включить напоминание
  MA -> API: POST /api/reminders { slotId }
  activate API
  API -> DB: create_reminder (start − 3h)
  API --> MA: 201
  deactivate API
end

note over MA: Session хранит user.id\nвсе запросы несут x-user-id header
@enduml